    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007, I, Ranil Wickremesinghe, Minister of Finance, Economic Stabilization and National Policies of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by this order impose in respect of the commodity specified in Column I of the Schedule hereto a Special Commodity Levy at the rate specified in the corresponding entry in Column II of that Schedule.",
